cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use CraftBench-UE in your work, please cite the paper (below under
  preferred-citation), not this repository.
title: CraftBench-UE
abstract: >-
  A benchmark and evaluation harness for AI coding agents on Unreal Engine 5.8
  gameplay-programming tasks. Each task is a behaviour spec with no answer key;
  submissions are graded by a deterministic verifier that builds the project
  with UnrealBuildTool, runs it in headless Play-In-Editor, and inspects runtime
  traces and generated assets. No language model participates in the PASS/FAIL
  decision.
